    "chunk_text": "\ufffdys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re twelftan wucan ofer pentecosten. \u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re forman lenctenwucan. \u00d0ys godspel sceal to Sancta Agnan m\u00e6ssan. \u00d0ys godspel sceal in octabas Petri et Pauli. \u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone \u00feryddan wodnesd\u00e6g innan lenctene. \u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone forman \u00feunresd\u00e6g innan lenctene. \u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re eahto\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten. \u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re eahto\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten. \u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on Petres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g. \u00d0ys godspel sceal on Sancte Laurentius m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g. \u00d0ys sceal on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re forman lencten wucan. \u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fiftan wucan ofer pentecosten. \u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g to \u00feam f\u00e6stene \u00e6r h\u00e6rfestes emnyhte. \u00d0ys sceal on Sancte Michaeles m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g. \u00d0is sceal on tiwesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feryddan lenctenwucan. \u00d0ys sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re xxiii wucan ofer pentecosten. \u00d0ys sceal to Sancte Paulus m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge and to Sancte Benedictus. \u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone sunnand\u00e6g \u00fee man belyc\u00f0 alleluia. \u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0re lenctenwucan. \u00d0ys sceal on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wuc",
